<title>FRANCE: Aerospatiale has no comment on Boeing deal.</title>
<headline>Aerospatiale has no comment on Boeing deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>French state-owned Aerospatiale, one of the four companies making up the Airbus Industrie consortium, said on Wednesday that it had no comment on a European Union decision to allow a merger of Boeing Co with McDonnell Douglas Corp.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no comment to make,&quot; a spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
